<title>GREECE: Intrakom wins Greek cardphone contract.</title>
<headline>Intrakom wins Greek cardphone contract.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Greece's state telecoms OTE said it awarded a contract for 30,000 new-technology cardphones to the Intrakom group.</p>
</text>
